OL,3,ATimothee Chalamet and Zendaya prank
OL,4,ARylan Clark for Children in Need
OL,5,
OL,6,FTimothee Chalamet and his Dune co-stars
OL,7,Fwere seen pranking Rylan Clark during
OL,8,Fthis year's Children in Need on Friday.
OL,10,FThe Oscar-nominated actor was set up
OL,11,Fwith behind-the-scenes suggestions in
OL,12,Fan Impractical Jokers-style set-up
OL,13,Fduring an interview with Zendaya, Jason
OL,14,FMomoa and Anya Taylor-Joy about the
OL,15,Fthird instalment of the film franchise.
OL,17,FThis year's Children in Need show also
OL,18,Ffeatured Radio 2 presenter Owain Wyn
OL,19,FEvans and a "challenge squad" of young
OL,20,Fpeople completing feats in the name of
OL,21,Fcharity.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
